       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-AUTONOMY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-AUTONOMY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-VISUAL-CONTINUITY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REVERSAL-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-DISSONANCE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-USER-AUTONOMY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AUTONOMY-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-AUTONOMY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-AUTONOMY-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-AUTONOMY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CONTINUITY-AND-REVERSAL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DISSONANCE-AND-AUTONOMY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-AUTONOMY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CONTINUITY-AND-REVERSAL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VISUAL-CONTINUITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REVERSAL-LATENCY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DISSONANCE-AND-AUTONOMY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-DISSONANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-USER-AUTONOMY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-AUTONOMY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-VISUAL-CONTINUITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-REVERSAL-LATENCY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-DISSONANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-USER-AUTONOMY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-AUTONOMY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-AUTONOMY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-AUTONOMY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-AUTONOMY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-AUTONOMY-CODE.
